    "updated_at": "2017-10-16T08:17:31Z",
    "body": "Even if `import()` can be sensitive, does it mean it's better for it to do so? It seems like it would requiring carrying more data around and might lead to developer surprise when they interchange `import` and `fetch()` (e.g., in polyfills).",
