    "created_at": "2017-10-22T15:43:54Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-10-22T15:44:03Z",
    "body": "If we make the fix proposed in #3117, it will behave the same way as eval(). If we don't, it will not. Making the fix seems clearly correct for base URL/credentials mode.\r\n\r\nThe real question is whether it should behave the same as eval() for nonce and parser metadata, or if there was some explicit reason @mikewest reset those to empty string when he integrated CSP and setTimeout earlier.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
